Description: Additional facilities for PostgreSQL 16
 The postgresql-contrib package contains contributed packages that are
 included in the PostgreSQL distribution but are not officially supported
 by the PostgreSQL core team.
 .
 This package contains the contrib modules for PostgreSQL 16.
